  "steps": [
    "To a bowl add 125ml milk, 2 tbsp cocoa powder, 4 tbsp cornstarch.",
    "Mix well until nice and smooth with no lumps.",
    "Then to a pan on medium heat add: 250ml milk, 1 tbsp honey.",
    "Mix well and bring it to a gentle boil.",
    "Once the milk starts to boil, switch off the flame.",
    "Pour in the cocoa slurry through a sieve to remove any lumps.",
    "Immediately mix everything together until smooth and thick.",
    "Transfer the pudding into 2 small circular bowls and refrigerate overnight or until completely set.",
    "Once set, flip the pudding onto a plate, dust with some cocoa powder and it’s ready!"
